	"transcription": [
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:00,000",
				"to": "00:00:02,700"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 0,
				"to": 2700
			},
			"text": " We've got the most controlled border we've ever had in the history."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:02,700",
				"to": "00:00:06,980"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 2700,
				"to": 6980
			},
			"text": " Yet liberal politician Josh Turic supports amnesty for illegals."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:06,980",
				"to": "00:00:09,280"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 6980,
				"to": 9280
			},
			"text": " We need an easier pathway to citizenship."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:09,280",
				"to": "00:00:13,700"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 9280,
				"to": 13700
			},
			"text": " Turic voted to give taxpayer-funded welfare benefits to illegal immigrants."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:13,700",
				"to": "00:00:15,740"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 13700,
				"to": 15740
			},
			"text": " Said cracking down on illegals was..."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:15,740",
				"to": "00:00:17,580"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 15740,
				"to": 17580
			},
			"text": " Fundamentally wrong in Un-American."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:17,580",
				"to": "00:00:21,880"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 17580,
				"to": 21880
			},
			"text": " Turic was even caught telling illegal immigrants how to obstruct law enforcement."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:21,880",
				"to": "00:00:23,980"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 21880,
				"to": 23980
			},
			"text": " Liberal politician Josh Turic."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:23,980",
				"to": "00:00:25,760"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 23980,
				"to": 25760
			},
			"text": " Fundamentally wrong in Un-American."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:25,760",
				"to": "00:00:30,140"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 25760,
				"to": 30140
			},
			"text": " Paid for by S.L.F. pack. Not authorized by any candidate or candidates committee. S.L.F. pack."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:30,140",
				"to": "00:00:31,880"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 30140,
				"to": 31880
			},
			"text": " We were never going to get another chance at this."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:31,880",
				"to": "00:00:33,800"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 31880,
				"to": 33800
			},
			"text": " That was the thing that was actually the most scary for me."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:33,800",
				"to": "00:00:36,520"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 33800,
				"to": 36520
			},
			"text": " We get one chance to get this out."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:36,520",
				"to": "00:00:39,400"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 36520,
				"to": 39400
			},
			"text": " If we get caught, if I make a mistake, no one else gets to do this."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:39,400",
				"to": "00:00:41,240"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 39400,
				"to": 41240
			},
			"text": " You know you only get one shot at it."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:41,240",
				"to": "00:00:42,440"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 41240,
				"to": 42440
			},
			"text": " You already have enough skin in the game."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:42,440",
				"to": "00:00:44,100"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 42440,
				"to": 44100
			},
			"text": " You might have just put a little bit more skin in the game."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:49,200",
				"to": "00:00:52,440"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 49200,
				"to": 52440
			},
			"text": " Today we're talking to meta whistleblower Francis Howgen,"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:52,440",
				"to": "00:00:57,520"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 52440,
				"to": 57520
			},
			"text": " who famously worked with the Wall Street Journal to expose how meta's algorithms"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:57,520",
				"to": "00:01:01,560"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 57520,
				"to": 61560
			},
			"text": " were radicalizing people, making teen girls feel horrible on Instagram."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:01,560",
				"to": "00:01:03,640"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 61560,
				"to": 63640
			},
			"text": " And lots of other really bad things."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:03,640",
				"to": "00:01:06,940"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 63640,
				"to": 66940
			},
			"text": " Francis became a whistleblower back in 2021."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:06,940",
				"to": "00:01:10,000"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 66940,
				"to": 70000
			},
			"text": " And her story is the basis for the social reckoning,"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:10,000",
				"to": "00:01:12,720"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 70000,
				"to": 72720
			},
			"text": " which is Aaron Sorkin's follow-up to the social network."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:12,720",
				"to": "00:01:13,600"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 72720,
				"to": 73600
			},
			"text": " Let's jump into it."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:13,600",
				"to": "00:01:15,760"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 73600,
				"to": 75760
			},
			"text": " This is a really great interview with Francis."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:15,760",
				"to": "00:01:17,260"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 75760,
				"to": 77260
			},
			"text": " I really enjoyed it."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:19,820",
				"to": "00:01:21,800"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 79820,
				"to": 81800
			},
			"text": " Hi Francis. Thank you so much for joining us."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:21,800",
				"to": "00:01:23,360"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 81800,
				"to": 83360
			},
			"text": " I'm really excited to talk to you."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:23,360",
				"to": "00:01:27,040"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 83360,
				"to": 87040
			},
			"text": " I have been following your work and your story ever since you"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:27,040",
				"to": "00:01:30,800"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 87040,
				"to": 90800
			},
			"text": " became a whistleblower from Facebook, which was in 2021."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:30,800",
				"to": "00:01:35,440"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 90800,
				"to": 95440
			},
			"text": " I just saw the social reckoning literally one hour before having this conversation."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:35,440",
				"to": "00:01:36,560"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 95440,
				"to": 96560
			},
			"text": " I thought it was great."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:36,560",
				"to": "00:01:37,800"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 96560,
				"to": 97800
			},
			"text": " I want to start there."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:37,800",
				"to": "00:01:40,400"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 97800,
				"to": 100400
			},
			"text": " I guess we can kind of back into your story."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:40,400",
				"to": "00:01:44,480"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 100400,
				"to": 104480
			},
			"text": " But when did you figure out that Aaron Sorkin was interested in telling your story?"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:45,120",
				"to": "00:01:50,080"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 105120,
				"to": 110080
			},
			"text": " So I would say like maybe like six months after I first came forward,"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:50,080",
				"to": "00:01:54,640"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 110080,
				"to": 114640
			},
			"text": " I was in LA for a conference and they said,"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:54,640",
				"to": "00:01:57,200"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 114640,
				"to": 117200
			},
			"text": " you know, Aaron Sorkin is interested in talking to you."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:57,200",
				"to": "00:02:02,880"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 117200,
				"to": 122880
			},
			"text": " And I don't think it was as explicit as like they want to make a companion piece"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:02:02,880",
				"to": "00:02:05,920"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 122880,
				"to": 125920
			},
			"text": " to the social network and have you be a major character in it."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:02:05,920",
				"to": "00:02:10,880"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 125920,
				"to": 130880
			},
			"text": " It was more like, you know, if I were to do a follow-up, what would be interesting?"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:02:10,880",
				"to": "00:02:12,560"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 130880,
				"to": 132560
			},
			"text": " Like explain to me why you did what you did."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:02:12,560",
				"to": "00:02:13,600"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 132560,
				"to": 133600
			},
			"text": " Like why does this matter?"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:02:13,600",
				"to": "00:02:16,720"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 133600,
				"to": 136720
			},
			"text": " One of the things I think the movie does a really, really good job of capturing"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:02:16,720",
				"to": "00:02:22,720"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 136720,
				"to": 142720
			},
			"text": " is the topics that were in my disclosures are not just complicated for an everyday person"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:02:22,720",
				"to": "00:02:27,040"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 142720,
				"to": 147040
			},
			"text": " to understand, they're complicated for people who are really deeply steeped"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:02:27,040",
				"to": "00:02:28,720"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 147040,
				"to": 148720
			},
			"text": " in how social media works."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:02:28,720",
				"to": "00:02:30,640"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 148720,
				"to": 150640
			},
			"text": " Like I thought the movie did a really good job of capturing."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:02:30,640",
				"to": "00:02:33,360"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 150640,
				"to": 153360
			},
			"text": " Like there were things that I knew for certain when I went to Jeff"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:02:33,360",
				"to": "00:02:37,440"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 153360,
				"to": 157440
			},
			"text": " and there were things that he and I figured out together by looking through a lot of documentation."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:02:37,440",
				"to": "00:02:40,560"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 157440,
				"to": 160560
			},
			"text": " So imagine you have someone like Aaron who's like a smart person."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:02:40,560",
				"to": "00:02:43,440"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 160560,
				"to": 163440
			},
			"text": " He's really clued in on a lot of things in the world."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:02:43,440",
				"to": "00:02:47,760"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 163440,
				"to": 167760
			},
			"text": " But we're talking about stuff that is a specialty amongst specialists."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:02:47,760",
				"to": "00:02:51,120"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 167760,
				"to": 171120
			},
			"text": " How much can you actually convey in an hour and hour and a half?"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:02:51,120",
				"to": "00:02:57,120"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 171120,
				"to": 177120
			},
			"text": " So I had never imagined that you could make what I went through into an interesting story."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:02:57,120",
				"to": "00:02:59,440"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 177120,
				"to": 179440
			},
			"text": " So like when I didn't hear from him again for a while, I didn't."
		}
	]
